# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# leuk — environment configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# This variable is OPTIONAL. leuk works perfectly without it, but
# GitHub's unauthenticated REST API caps you at 60 requests/hour.
#
# With a token you get 5,000 requests/hour. After heavy use or many
# visitors, setting one is recommended.
#
# To create a token:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   2. "Tokens (classic)" → "Generate new token"
#   3. Scope: you only need the "public_repo" (read) or no scopes for
#      purely public-data reads. Leave scopes unchecked for public-only.
#   4. Copy the token and paste it below (no quotes).
#   5. NEVER commit a real token — this file's key should stay empty in git.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
GITHUB_TOKEN=